WEBVTT

00:14:27.195 --> 00:14:30.407
to deal with this epidemic of boring.

00:14:31.575 --> 00:14:32.993
Just like in nature,

00:14:32.993 --> 00:14:37.331
we've learned the vast
importance of biodiversity,

00:14:37.372 --> 00:14:42.002
we now desperately need
architectural diversity.

00:14:43.795 --> 00:14:48.759
(Applause)

00:14:48.759 --> 00:14:52.846
My goal is to try to help trigger

00:14:52.888 --> 00:14:55.641
a global humanizing movement

00:14:55.682 --> 00:14:59.686
that no longer tolerates
soulless, inhuman places.